{"server":"tw","storyId":"act18side_level_act18side_07_end","groupId":"act18side","stageId":"act18side_07","title":"昇華之夜","storyCode":"LE-7","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_07_end.txt","sourceHash":"c04a18bf6ad9b8ef6953da0fc749a06c1276e200c573e620354c7756a45cc373","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g3_slumstreets_night"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給我躺下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別做夢了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虧你還能騰出手來......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_i06"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這次我來真的了，斯特羅洛女士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你——算計我？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，你也有力不從心的時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還早呢，你也不過是仗著塵世之音......論法術的操控，你還早了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喝啊！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g3_slumstreets_night"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼、呼、呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打、打倒了嗎......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵，烏提卡伯爵，沒想到，我居然輸給了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也會認輸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，輸了就是輸了，難道我不承認，就會變成我的勝利嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......為什麼你還能這麼從容不迫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為......你們又能拿我怎麼樣呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是這座城市的領主，你們在深夜闖入了我管理的音樂廳，並且妄圖拆除一些經過我批准的合法改造。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至我想要阻止你們，還被你們打傷——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏提卡伯爵，羅德島的人，還有你，車爾尼，該擔心的，是你們才對，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格特魯德，你還是這麼卑鄙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卑鄙？這就是你對於資金援助了你十幾年的金主的態度嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"車爾尼，這座音樂廳是我讓你使用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身為區區一個感染者，你現在的地位，也是我給你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你心心念念的夕照區，也是在我的仁慈之下苟延殘喘到今天的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請回吧，各位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可未必。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏提卡伯爵的身份，在萊塔尼亞意味著一種恥辱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這也意味著，我的所到之處，不會沒有女皇的眼線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那又如何？我剛才說了，現在是你們妄圖破壞我的音樂廳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使女皇陛下的密探真的出現，他也應該將你們逮捕，而不是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別格勒，別格勒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是應該把一切都看在眼裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道你還打算袖手旁觀嗎？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到的，是堂堂烏提卡伯爵竟然在深夜帶人強闖音樂廳。除此之外，我什麼都沒看到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒聽到她的陰謀嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是指斯特羅洛伯爵的陰謀，還是指烏提卡伯爵與斯特羅洛伯爵共同參與的陰謀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我確實聽到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，即使我將你們剛才的對話全都錄下來，也無法證明任何東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"證據，烏提卡伯爵，凡事都要講究證據，有什麼證據證明斯特羅洛伯爵意圖反抗女皇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"證據，事到如今你還來和我提證據......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，塵世之音！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一起在下水道發現的塵世之音研究！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你還不算太蠢，烏提卡伯爵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼研究？我完全不知道呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到了這一步還裝傻就沒意思了，斯特羅洛伯爵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你確實跟下水道那個實驗室裡的筆記和計畫書沒有直接關係，但我們也有我們的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有了下水道的線索，要找出你其他的據點並不困難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，你涉嫌開展被陛下明令禁止的塵世之音研究，跟我走一趟吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，只是因為她研究塵世之音？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要再次向你重申，烏提卡伯爵，還有你們其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你們沒有明確的證據，證明你們所說的惡果確實會發生——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們對她的所有指控都只會變成誣衊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我看一看那些塵世之音的研究記錄，我可以給出詳盡的證明！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，那是屬於萊塔尼亞的機密，我不可能交給一個來自國外的組織。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是耍賴嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這片大地上不盡如人意的事情多著呢，小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，芙蓉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的意思很明確了，我們的發現不足以給斯特羅洛伯爵定罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而他出現，只是因為他找到了別的給斯特羅洛伯爵定罪的證據。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至應該感謝你願意在我的大吼大叫下出現，對吧，別格勒，我親愛的密探先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平心而論，如果要我把你和斯特羅洛伯爵這樣的貴族放在一起比較，我會更喜歡你一些，烏提卡伯爵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，車爾尼先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在斯特羅洛伯爵已經被我們控制，就算你們擔心的情況不是無中生有，音樂會也已經沒有危險了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，我還是推薦您取消這場音樂會，這是最為穩妥的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為明天的音樂會已經被禁止了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"舉辦與否依然由您決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別格勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_486_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，斯特羅洛伯爵，我相信您對女皇陛下的忠誠，我只是想要請您共進......早餐，您會答應我的邀請，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，一頓從凌晨開始的早餐？好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特魯德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏提卡伯爵，你會為背叛我而後悔的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會為許多事後悔，但唯獨這一件，絕不。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就這麼讓他們走了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格特魯德......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還有話想跟她說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果髒話也算數的話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g4_embassy"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白堊還沒有醒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交給我吧，我即刻啟程，帶他去羅德島本艦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要帶走他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，在羅德島他才能得到妥善治療。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你們能讓他的病情穩定，但塵世之音怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不懷疑你們的醫療水準，但你們真的能解決塵世之音嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不敢保證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我們已經沒有其他選擇了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別告訴我，你還相信格特魯德告訴你的，透過合奏來去除塵世之音的手段？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我問你，從維謝海姆到你口中的本艦，要多長時間？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不說話，因為你知道，白堊有可能挺不過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可就算格特魯德說的是真的，你難道打算犧牲自己去做這件事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要我做得到，為什麼不？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"芙蓉愣了一下。\n面前的青年，眼神和一開始相遇時截然不同。\n他是認真的，她想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算我盡可能地幫你，但我們對塵世之音的瞭解太少，還全是從那個伯爵嘴裡聽說的，真假難辨......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來我趕上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老先生，您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們需要更多關於塵世之音的資訊，我這裡有一份計畫書。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老先生，你難道是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道你也跟別格勒一樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們應該想到的，白堊是當年計畫的漏網之鱗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女皇陛下怎麼可能放任這樣一個不安定因素自由地流浪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你們共同流浪了十幾年！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以才不令人起疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可別格勒不是說什麼機密——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我從他那裡偷來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這樣能救白堊，這種早該見鬼去的計畫給人看又有什麼關係！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您、您別激動，您還很虛弱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"計畫書我來看，芙蓉，你把老人家扶下去休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g3_slumstreets_night"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......老先生，白堊他，知道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有告訴過他，但他很聰明，隱隱約約肯定猜到了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這對他太殘忍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殘忍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，你知道我是怎麼成為感染者的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你肯定聽說過，女皇陛下掌權的時代之前，萊塔尼亞對於古典源石技藝的探索到達了一個難以逾越的高度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，為了達到這樣的高度，萊塔尼亞付出了怎樣的代價，你知道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是無數的人命，其中包括大量的感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那個時期，一些選帝侯甚至把定期上交一定量的感染者當成規矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但感染者也是人，哪會等著送死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"於是，到了最後，你猜會發生什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道說......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你猜到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......只要用源石在你胳膊上劃一下，你就也是合格的感染者了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是這麼感染的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g5_czernyhome"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"旋律......旋律，塵世之音竟然是巫王遺留下來的旋律！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然是這樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，就應該是這樣才對！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫王不僅是萊塔尼亞最強大的術師，也是萊塔尼亞最為可怖的音樂家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫王在音樂上的造詣極高，甚至有人說，他在音樂上的探索與對源石技藝的研究是同等水準的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，節奏、調性、織體......這些構成音樂之美的要素被他棄之如敝履，他留存於世的每一首曲子都充滿了侵略性與毀滅性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的作品早都變成萊塔尼亞的禁曲了。如果塵世之音是一段又一段巫王留下的旋律——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，塵世之音無疑是巫王留下的作品，而你們則是他作品的延伸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不是他的作品！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒必要自欺欺人。而且，如果是這樣的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有辦法了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要你們重現逼退源石蟲的合奏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們在那時，抓住了自己身上的塵世之音，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"合奏？現在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道現在是什麼情況嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，而且我比你更清楚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽車爾尼先生的吧，黑鍵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白堊，你好些了嗎？你一個人過來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行板送我來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你不能再像之前那樣去貼合塵世之音的旋律了，上次你的狀態就很不對......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想留下遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼......車爾尼先生，您想到了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果說塵世之音是一段又一段的旋律，那麼，無論是曾經用你們做實驗的那些巫王殘黨，還是格特魯德......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們要做的，必然是引導這些旋律中蘊含的源石技藝，或者說，這種源石技藝中流淌的旋律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，他們對於塵世之音的探索，都在於挖掘其中的所謂奧秘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通俗地說，就是讓塵世之音更加“響亮”，更加“美妙”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，有一點我可以很明確地告訴你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這份計畫書上，沒有任何能夠“轉移”塵世之音的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我已經不驚訝了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這並不是因為這樣做太過困難，恰恰相反，只是因為在他們看來，這樣做是暴殄天物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為每一段巫王留下的旋律都是不同的，它們來自各個時期，包含著截然不同的情緒和思考。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將兩節完全不同的樂曲拼湊在一起能有什麼意義？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你們之前的合奏一樣，你們越是探索，效果就越是災難性的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至連源石蟲落荒而逃，也是因為覺得你們的演奏太過刺耳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們想必做過類似的轉移研究，並且發現效果並不好......吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，哪怕兩節樂曲截然不同，只要經過足夠的鋪墊，也能夠完成轉折。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我要你們演奏我的《晨暮》。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接著，我要你們在樂曲中挖掘自我，就像你們傍晚時做的那樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要感受到塵世之音留在你們身上的旋律，然後，由我來為你們作一首新曲子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，無論如何，要轉移塵世之音的話，它總是需要一個容器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而從實驗結果來看，兩段塵世之音被植入同一個人的實驗失敗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來做這個容器，你就是這個意思吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要以為你那點決心就夠自我犧牲了，小子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會盡可能地去嘗試用演奏將你們兩個體內的塵世之音都拉扯出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果做不到，我會親自來做這個容器，如果我可以的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......為什麼你要為我們做到這一步？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒記錯的話，我的《晨暮》是你學習長笛的契機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是又怎樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你應該聽說過我是如何將它創作出來的，雖然我一點也不希望別人知道，但格特魯德那個女人非要把那點東西當成我的所謂“賣點”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你失去了最重要的知己，在悲痛中創作了這首樂曲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“悲痛”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個形容並不準確。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該用“悲憤”來形容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是我第一次明白，生活並不會如我所想的那樣發展，也是我第一次理解到音樂對我的意義——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反抗既定的命運。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g3_slumstreets_night"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把普通人變成感染者，這種事也太殘忍了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道咒駡過多少次巫王的殘暴，可能是我的咒駡真的被誰聽到了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我被送到實驗場之前，女皇陛下推翻了巫王。我得救了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"於是我發誓，我會把自己全部的生命奉獻給陛下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以您才成了密探？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"密探平時是怎樣工作的，我不能告訴你，你也沒有必要知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只要知道，當年查出那夥研究塵世之音的巫王殘黨的密探，就是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當我們發現這夥人的時候，他們在白堊身上做的實驗已經失敗了，他已經變成了今天這樣的體質。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們沒有打算救他，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"據我所知，雙子女皇上位之後，就明令禁止了巫王時代的所有研究，而塵世之音相關的研究，顯然在這個行列中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而塵世之音如果真的是非常厲害的東西，我覺得它不可能在巫王被推翻後到現在的二十年間都沒有出現在人們視野中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何況，“巫王在其中留下了自己的痕跡”“巫王在旋律中留下了力量”，這些說法的核心，都是巫王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對塵世之音的追求，或許更像是出於對巫王本人的崇拜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而從別格勒先生的做法看來，密探的原則，是為了女皇的利益服務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，對你們而言，塵世之音對女皇毫無利益可言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，你在之前做出那麼莽撞的事，我還以為你是個蠢材。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在看來，你只是不知道怎樣去運用自己的才智。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你猜得對。我都把計畫書給你們帶過來了，這部分也就沒什麼好掩蓋的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塵世之音非常特殊，它無疑是巫王在這片大地上留下的殘響，它也確實蘊含著力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但只有那些巫王的狂熱信徒相信，巫王在其中留下了自己的分身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塵世之音中蘊含的力量過於獨特，無法被普遍應用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，對於現在宮廷裡的術師們來說，研究塵世之音是一件缺乏價值的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"於是，黑鍵和白堊的處理就成了一個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為黑鍵比較安全，所以他被選上了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，我們需要宣佈這個計畫最終的失敗，而身體沒有問題的黑鍵自然是最好的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白堊卻因為身體已經出現問題，而不得不面臨......死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他好不容易逃出了巫王殘黨的魔爪，卻還要面臨死亡......這未免也太過分了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許在你看來，我們的做法不近人情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但當你經歷過許多悲劇，許多由做不到不近人情的人引發的悲劇後，你會知道——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不能對任何事都投入感情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是別格勒......你應該覺得他很無情吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我確實這麼覺得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你不知道的是，他在夕照區生活了十幾年，和這裡的人朝夕相處，他對夕照區的感情不比任何人少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他恨不得把格特魯德千刀萬剮，只是他做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為，對他說的話最憤怒的人，是你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別格勒......先生，他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，白堊的體質導致了他會危害旁人，他無法和任何人親近，這段過去也讓他註定無法過上正常人的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他實際上沒得選。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但您還是對他投入了感情，給了他死以外的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這算是選擇嗎？跟著一個半死不活的老頭子在大地上流浪，學會了拉大提琴，卻連大提琴都不怎麼碰得到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能交朋友，甚至不能和人親近，這樣的日子也能叫生活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他活下來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也許吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看著那個瑟瑟發抖的孩子，我的手臂至今還會感到刺痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫王......巫王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、白堊、無意間感染的感染者、被迫感染的感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫王給萊塔尼亞留下的傷口還在流血，今天竟然還有人渴望著他的歸來，甚至還有貴族包庇著巫王殘黨們的研究。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我恨啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我恨我不能活到他們全部伏法的那一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您會活下去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用安慰我了，小姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陪著這個孩子生活了這麼多年，我能活到今天本來就是個奇跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個孩子對我來說，就像真正的孫子一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次帶著他來這裡，我其實想過，要不要把他介紹給別格勒，給他也謀個密探的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣，我死後也能放點心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但到了現在，我已經不在乎密不密探的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直以為，作為密探為女皇陛下付出一切就是我的命運，但現在看來，也不全是這樣啊，呵呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老先生......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"咣噹。\n一聲巨響從房間裡傳來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爺爺","speakerId":"avg_npc_495_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，讓我這個老頭子在這裡坐一會。去幫他們吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您如果感到哪裡不舒服，請一定要叫我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g5_czernyhome"},{"type":"narration","text":"塵世之音一開始並沒有名字。\n因為那是被巫王拋棄的旋律。\n宮廷樂師們將他一時興起，信手拈來的旋律一一記錄。\n若說巫王完整創作的樂曲如同深淵傳來的怒號，那麼，那些斷片確實是尚且屬於塵世的旋律。\n於是，這些斷片被命名為塵世之音。\n即便如此，巫王的力量依然太過可怖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑鍵，雖然我之前要求你讓我看到在音樂上純粹的你，但是現在——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要你回憶你過去十幾年的生活，把你的憤懣傾瀉出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"音樂是你生活的寫照，是你的步伐，是你窺探大地的雙眼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要被你的情緒蒙蔽，但也不要背叛你的情緒，去探索，去宣洩，去將你靈魂深處的旋律拉扯出來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......找到了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，沒錯，沒錯，就是這個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是刻在你腦海中的旋律......這是毀滅的旋律，摧枯拉朽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你，恰恰相反，白堊，我要你壓抑自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你太過毫無保留，你包容了你所經歷的一切，你知不知道，你的善良是你最大的弱點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和解？為什麼要和解？憑什麼和解？誰有什麼資格勸你和解？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都認為你值得更好的，你也不是沒有這麼想過，不是嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......即便到了現在，你也不願改變自己的想法，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也罷，也罷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣也足夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的旋律，我也感受到了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虛無，吞噬一切的虛無。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"撐住！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩股截然不同的源石技藝力量開始在屋內糾纏，兩個青年的臉上也開始浮現出痛苦的神色。\n車爾尼知道，是該自己出手的時候了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保持你們的演奏，不要慌張，如果感覺身體有問題，馬上停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，如果你們感覺到問題不是出在自己身上，那就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把一切交給我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"車爾尼坐到了鋼琴前，他深吸一口氣，開始了他的演奏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"然而，當他嘗試去理順兩股截然不同的力量時，他意識到了自己的自不量力。\n那是強大的，憤怒的，恐怖的，悲壯的，鮮血的，尖叫的——\n卻又讓人不由自主沉浸其中的旋律。\n他在某一時刻對巫王突然充滿仇恨，在下一秒卻又發自內心地憧憬。\n他在某一時刻感覺自己如同初生的孩童，但馬上，他感到了歲月在自己身上的流逝，下一秒，他已經垂垂老矣。\n當他用僅存的理性迫使自己保持自己的樣貌時，他感覺自己彷彿在一片無邊的荒漠中前行，風沙太大，他根本無法睜開雙眼。\n他拼盡全力撥開風沙，然後，他看到了一堵直達天際的高牆，牆上什麼都沒有，沒有痛苦，沒有憤怒，沒有死亡。\n一堵純粹的牆。\n他在一刹那理解了，這是他不可能逾越的壁障。\n恐懼在這一刻充斥了他的心靈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"narration","text":"車爾尼劇烈地咳嗽起來，鮮血從他的口中噴湧而出。\n他咳得太厲害，想要起身喝水，卻踉蹌著把身旁的譜架撞倒在地上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你沒事吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"車爾尼先生！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在外面聽到了聲音，出什麼事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一點小事而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在我能理解了，恐怕不是沒有人做過和我一樣的嘗試，只是他們大概都死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還有心情笑？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"車爾尼先生，您嘴角有血跡......我幫您擦一擦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們剛才感覺如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......雖然在引出塵世之音的時候感覺到了很強烈的撕碎感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在您介入之後，確實能感覺到壓力小了許多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣至少證明，我的想法是有可行性的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是您已經......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是吐了一口血而已，我自己的身體我自己清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們繼續。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會死的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能活到今天，是因為格特魯德覺得我還有價值，捨得花錢給我買藥，讓我能夠比普通感染者多活幾年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但今天如果不能完成這首曲子，對我來說，與死亡無異。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你不想讓我毫無意義地死去，那就拿起你的長笛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白堊，你的演奏太弱了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要顧慮我，你沒有這個資格！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你的生存問題，不是我的，不要以為無私奉獻是一種美德！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的付出時而也是一種負擔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去喊叫，去發洩，去爭取你理應獲得的回報！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，我的對手是我自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳、嘔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"車爾尼先生，您又咳血了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（他根本沒有聽到我說的話......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們去休息吧，黑鍵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡已經不需要我們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白堊","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要做的，是養精蓄銳，等待車爾尼先生寫好新曲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......芙蓉，他就麻煩你照顧了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我至少不會讓他比我先倒下。去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_i07"},{"type":"narration","text":"車爾尼的敵人不是巫王。\n縱使巫王犯下了累累罪行，縱使他也唾棄巫王，他卻不得不承認，音樂本身無關善惡。\n他的對手是此時此刻的自己。\n他不再嘗試攀登那堵令人絕望的高牆。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他開始演奏。\n他的腳下出現平台，平台托著他不斷上升，穿破雲端。\n即使高牆依然看不到盡頭，他卻已然不再在乎。\n即使他能感覺到洶湧的力量在自己的體內激蕩，讓他忍不住又咳出了幾口血。\n在一旁的芙蓉甚至產生了錯覺——\n她彷彿看到了車爾尼的生命在飛速流逝，但同時，他寫下的音符卻彷彿在咆哮著：\n拿去吧，都拿去吧！把他的一切都拿去吧！\n今天，就是車爾尼的死期！\n但車爾尼的音樂永遠不會死去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_i07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，咳、咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車爾尼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"完......成......了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_i07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太好了！您——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"音樂家想要起身，但他的上半身砸在鋼琴上，在黎明前留下了一個不協和的尾聲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
